{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20517","headline":"赠令狐博士 · 张籍","name":"赠令狐博士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头白新年六十余，近闻生计转空虚。\n久爲博士谁能识，自到长安赁舍居。\n骑马出随寻寺客，呼儿散写乞钱书。\n古来贤哲皆如此，应是才高与衆疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}